# Ingestion API

Use the ingestion endpoint when an SDK or OpenTelemetry exporter is not a fit. Authenticate every request with a project API key and send timestamps in ISO 8601 format.

```bash
curl -X POST https://uncoil.dev/api/ingest \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer uncoil_sk_live_..." \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"spanId":"span_123","runId":"run_123","spanType":"llm","createdAt":"2026-01-01T12:00:00Z","latencyMs":420}'
```

For existing telemetry pipelines, send OTLP HTTP JSON to `/api/otel`. API keys belong on the server and should be rotated through the project settings surface.
